<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>System Outage Alert</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      color: #333;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      background-color: #dc3545;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .body {
      padding: 30px 25px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .highlight {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #dc3545;
    }

    .note {
      background-color: #fff3cd;
      border-left: 5px solid #ffc107;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      color: #856404;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .cta {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }

    .cta a {
      background-color: #0c4a6e;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .cta a:hover {
      background-color: #083c56;
    }

    .footer {
      background-color: #f0f2f5;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #777;
      border-top: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #0c4a6e;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 6px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .body {
        padding: 20px 15px;
      }

      .header {
        font-size: 20px;
        padding: 20px 15px;
      }

      .cta a {
        padding: 10px 20px;
        font-size: 15px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      ⚠️ Temporary System Outage
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>We are currently experiencing a <span class="highlight">temporary outage</span> affecting certain EngageGPT services.</p>

      <div class="note">
        <strong>Outage Start:</strong> {{outageStart}}<br>
        <strong>Expected Restoration:</strong> {{expectedRestoration}}
      </div>

      <p>Our engineering team is actively working to identify and resolve the issue as quickly as possible. We understand how important uninterrupted access is for you and your team.</p>

      <p>We sincerely apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your patience and understanding during this time.</p>

      <div class="cta">
        <a href="https://engagegpt.in/status" target="_blank">Check Live Status</a>
      </div>

      <p>If you have urgent questions or need assistance, please don’t hesitate to reach out to our support team.</p>
      <p>Warm regards,<br/>The EngageGPT Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EngageGPT. All rights reserved.<br />
      <a href="https://engagegpt.in">Website</a> |
      <a href="mailto:engagegpt@gmail.com">Support</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
